<title>USA: Brandywine Realty acquires new properties.</title>
<headline>Brandywine Realty acquires new properties.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said on Monday that it acquired a six property, 608,008- square-foot portfolio for $66.2 million.</p>
<p>The portfolio consists of five office buildings in New Jersey and one office property in Pennsylvania, Brandywine said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company added that the acquisition underscored its penetration in in suburban Philadelphia and southern New Jersey.</p>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust is a full-service real estate company with 72 commercial and industrial properties.</p>
</text>
